  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Favourite slots are something of a necessity when you make a LOT of avatars just to get at the older ones for quicker access, and it'd be incredibly useful to just have a separate Favourites list comprised of avatars you've made.\nEg;  The \"general\" favourites list (plus the VRC+ ones), and something like, say, \"Personal\" Favourites that just dumps all self-uploaded Favourite-edd avatars into its own list.\nAlternatively, albeit taking a bit more work, perhaps a separate flavour of Favourite-ing your own avatars just so you can have quick access to your own ones and still have those 50 slots for other people's creations.",
